       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DAY05-05.

       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.

       01  COMPTEUR PIC 99 VALUE 1.
       01  TOTAL    PIC 999 VALUE 0.

       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           PERFORM UNTIL COMPTEUR > 20
                ADD COMPTEUR TO TOTAL
                ADD 1 TO COMPTEUR
           END-PERFORM

           DISPLAY 'TOTAL = ' TOTAL

           STOP RUN.
